1
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:09,030
-What are you doing? -I reorganized the fridge.
你在做什麼？ 我重新整理過冰箱

3
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:12,760
See? Bottom shelf, meats and dairy.
最底下放肉跟奶製品

4
00:00:13,310 --> 00:00:16,280
Middle shelf,fruits and vegetables.
中間放水果蔬菜

5
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:20,140
And top shelf,expired products.
最上面放過期食物

6
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:22,410
Why are you doing this?
你吃飽撐著啊？

7
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:24,810
Because I'm bored out of my mind.
因為我無聊到快抓狂了

8
00:00:25,090 --> 00:00:28,890
I've already been to the bank, post office and dry cleaners.
我已經去過 銀行、郵局、乾洗店

9
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:32,560
Dude,you just described seven days' worth of stuff.
老兄，你做完我一周的工作

10
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:36,490
Spread it out a little. Haven't you ever been unemployed?
你要放輕鬆一點 難道你從來沒失業過？

11
00:00:36,770 --> 00:00:39,000
I'm not unemployed. I'm on sabbatical.
我不是失業 只是進修中（有安息之意）

13
00:00:39,270 --> 00:00:42,130
Hey,don't get religious on me,okay?
少跟我傳教

14
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:46,770
A guy in your position needs to be better at relaxing.
你應該練習放輕鬆

15
00:00:47,010 --> 00:00:50,470
That's why we have comfortable chairs. Here,sit down.
不然我們家怎麼會有安樂椅？ 過來…坐下

17
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:53,940
Ready? Watch.
準備好沒？仔細看了

18
00:00:56,180 --> 00:00:57,780
And then....
然後…真好

19
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:02,280
-So,what? We just sit? -Oh,no,no.
就光坐著？ 當然不是

20
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:05,690
We're not gonna just sit. Watch.
不只是坐著 看好了

22
00:01:08,860 --> 00:01:12,060
-Hello,Chandler Bing. -Hello,Mr. Bing.
我是錢德賓 賓先生

24
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:14,190
I love you.
我愛你

25
00:01:14,970 --> 00:01:17,800
All right,whoever this is, stop calling me!
不管你是誰，別再打了

26
00:01:19,770 --> 00:01:22,170
It's been 6 months! It's not funny!
你已經騷擾我半年 一點也不好笑

27
00:01:23,910 --> 00:01:27,510
I can see you, Mr. Bing.
賓先生，我看得到你

28
00:01:27,650 --> 00:01:30,620
You look sexy in your new suit.
你穿新西裝真性感

29
00:01:30,750 --> 00:01:33,520
Leave me alone! For the love of God, leave me alone!
求你行行好，別再騷擾我了

30
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:35,980
And that's Wednesday.
這只是週三的樂子

31
00:01:37,831 --> 00:01:40,129
The One with The lnappropriate Sister
本集播出：「情比兄妹深」

00:01:41,831 --> 00:01:43,129
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

33
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:27,900
Hey,you guys! Guess what?
告訴你們

34
00:02:30,980 --> 00:02:32,340
The British are coming?
英國人要打來啦？

35
00:02:34,180 --> 00:02:36,080
Oh,you and your ways.
你的笑話真冷

36
00:02:37,990 --> 00:02:42,250
Since it's Christmas, I'm going to be collecting donations.
耶誕節快到了 我要負責去樂捐募款

37
00:02:42,490 --> 00:02:45,520
I have my bell and later on I get my bucket.
我已經拿到鈴鐺 過幾天就能拿到募捐筒

38
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:49,660
I'll be spreading joy to the people.
我要散播歡樂給大家

39
00:02:49,900 --> 00:02:52,870
Last year I spread a little joy, but not enough.
去年散播的不夠多

40
00:02:53,100 --> 00:02:55,700
So this year I'm doing the whole city.
今年一定要讓全紐約 都感受到

41
00:02:57,340 --> 00:03:01,740
I knew a girl in high school who did that. She was very popular.
我有個高中同學也跟你一樣 她很紅

43
00:03:02,510 --> 00:03:06,170
It's weird,you're starting to sound a lot like Chandler lately.
怪了，你口氣跟錢德越來越像

44
00:03:06,310 --> 00:03:08,150
That is so not true.
胡說八道

45
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:13,280
So,Phoebe,where are you doing your bell-ringing?
菲比，你要去哪裡搖鈴？

46
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:16,150
They gave me a great spot right by Macy's.
我分到梅西百貨旁當紅位子

47
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:18,790
They never give a good spot to a rookie...
新人很少分到這位子

48
00:03:18,990 --> 00:03:23,560
...but I'm the only one who can say "Merry Christmas" in 25 languages.
可是只有我會用25種語言 說耶誕快樂

49
00:03:24,030 --> 00:03:25,230
I lied!
我唬人的

50
00:03:26,530 --> 00:03:28,560
Oh,my God. Here's Danny.
天啊，丹尼在那邊

51
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:30,670
Just watch this.
你們看

52
00:03:33,470 --> 00:03:37,070
See? Still pretending he's not interested.
看見沒？還在假裝對我沒興趣

53
00:03:39,510 --> 00:03:42,240
He's coming over. Pretend we've forgotten who he is.
他走過來了，大家裝不認識他 忘記他是誰

54
00:03:42,650 --> 00:03:44,050
-Hey,guys. -Hey,Danny.
你們好 丹尼

55
00:03:46,390 --> 00:03:48,150
Oh,Danny! Hey!
丹尼

56
00:03:49,920 --> 00:03:54,490
You know Rachel. She's nice. She's not bad to look at,right?
丹尼，你認得瑞秋吧 她人很好，長得也不賴吧？

58
00:03:54,730 --> 00:03:55,820
Thanks,Mon.
謝了，摩妮卡

59
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,690
Of course.
當然啦

60
00:03:58,100 --> 00:04:00,660
Do you want to go out on a date with her?
你要不要跟她約會？

62
00:04:02,100 --> 00:04:04,440
Absolutely. Is Friday okay?
好啊，週五可以嗎？

63
00:04:06,270 --> 00:04:08,440
Friday is perfect. She can't wait.
非常好，她等不及要赴約

64
00:04:09,110 --> 00:04:12,380
On the date,I'll be able to talk to her directly?
約會時 我可以直接跟她說話吧？

65
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,370
See you Friday.
週五見

66
00:04:16,020 --> 00:04:19,780
Okay,what the hell was that? You know what? Don't answer me.
你搞什麼？ 算了，不用說了

68
00:04:20,090 --> 00:04:21,950
I have a date with Danny!
我要跟丹尼約會咯

69
00:04:23,590 --> 00:04:27,860
All right,it's 4:30, I guess my lunch break is over.
已經4點半，午休該結束了

70
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:31,560
-What are you guys gonna do? -lf you're going back to work...
你們等下要幹麼？ 既然你要回去上班

72
00:04:31,700 --> 00:04:35,070
...I'll probably just hang out. You know,make some calls.
我們大概一起打幾個電話吧 真不錯

74
00:04:41,210 --> 00:04:43,110
How could I not get the part?
我怎麼會落選？

75
00:04:43,310 --> 00:04:47,110
The play was about a 29-year-old ltalian actor from Queens!
主角就是出身皇后區的 29歲意大利演員

76
00:04:47,320 --> 00:04:50,340
Well,Talia Shire suddenly became available.
泰莉雅雪兒突然有空

77
00:04:50,550 --> 00:04:52,210
She's a woman!
她是歐巴桑耶

78
00:04:52,890 --> 00:04:55,720
What can I say? She nailed it!
你要我說什麼？ 人家就是有辦法

79
00:04:58,460 --> 00:05:00,120
Is there anything else?
好吧，還有什麼戲份？

80
00:05:00,330 --> 00:05:02,630
You'll just say no again,but...
你一定又會拒絕… 

81
00:05:02,900 --> 00:05:04,360
...gay porn?
同性戀A片？

82
00:05:07,300 --> 00:05:08,700
Happy holidays!
佳節快樂

83
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:10,800
Feliz Navidad!
耶誕快樂（西班牙文）

84
00:05:11,740 --> 00:05:14,070
Allo and Merry Christmas!
嗨（法文），耶誕快樂

85
00:05:14,340 --> 00:05:16,870
Oh,thank you,sir! Here's some joy.
謝謝你，祝你幸福

86
00:05:19,810 --> 00:05:21,870
-How's it going? -It's going okay.
我來看看你做得如何 很順利

88
00:05:22,150 --> 00:05:24,020
Good. Let me help you out.
那好，我順便捐點錢

90
00:05:24,250 --> 00:05:25,480
Oh,thanks!
謝謝 甭客氣

91
00:05:28,420 --> 00:05:31,820
Is that a new suede jacket? It looks really expensive.
新的鹿皮外套？好像很貴

92
00:05:33,330 --> 00:05:35,890
Yeah. I guess.
是不便宜

93
00:05:37,770 --> 00:05:39,560
Just get your nails done?
你剛去做指甲？

94
00:05:40,670 --> 00:05:43,600
Yes,Phoebe,but this is all I have,okay?
對，我只剩這些錢了

95
00:05:43,870 --> 00:05:46,840
Thanks. Happy holidays! Here's your joy.
謝啦，佳節快樂，祝你幸福

96
00:05:47,710 --> 00:05:50,230
Thank you! Happy holidays and Wait.
謝謝，佳節愉快 等等

97
00:05:50,510 --> 00:05:54,110
-You can't take money out. -I'm making change for the bus.
只能捐錢不能拿 我跟你換零錢搭公車

99
00:05:54,350 --> 00:05:56,910
Can't you leave the dollar for the poor?
拿零錢就好 其他錢是要救濟窮人的

100
00:05:57,190 --> 00:05:59,280
I'm poor. I gotta take the bus.
我就是窮人，而且還得搭公車

101
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:02,450
Okay,season's greetings and everything, but still
佳節愉快，可是你不能…

102
00:06:02,690 --> 00:06:03,880
Bite me, blondie!
咬我啊，小妞

103
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:11,020
I'm going to give him something besides joy. Just
除了祝他幸福，我還要…

104
00:06:15,140 --> 00:06:18,160
I can't believe I didn't get that part.
那個角色根本就是為我而寫 結果我竟然落選

105
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:20,600
I'm sorry,man.
很遺憾

106
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:22,510
What you should do...
你知道該怎麼做嗎？

107
00:06:22,780 --> 00:06:25,300
...is make something happen for yourself.
你要自己創造機會

108
00:06:25,510 --> 00:06:27,740
You know, like write a play.
例如寫個電影劇本

109
00:06:28,020 --> 00:06:31,510
Or a movie. What about those Good Will Hunting guys?
或者拍部電影 就像「心靈捕手」那兩個

111
00:06:31,790 --> 00:06:35,520
Be realistic,you know? If I did write something...
羅斯，少作白日夢了 就算我寫出劇本

113
00:06:35,790 --> 00:06:39,420
...what are the chances I could get those guys to star in it?
哪有辦法請到他們？

114
00:06:42,500 --> 00:06:44,520
Wait a second. I could star in it!
有了，我可以自己主演

115
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:45,790
Or that.
也可以

116
00:06:47,770 --> 00:06:50,640
I can't write. I mean,I'm an actor.
我不會寫劇本 我是演員

117
00:06:50,770 --> 00:06:53,900
I could act like a writer. Here....
我可以裝成編劇

119
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:01,780
But see? Nada.
不過…什麼也寫不出來

120
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:06,480
I don't have the discipline that it takes. I can't do it.
我不像編劇一樣有紀律 我辦不到

122
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:08,380
I'll help you.
我可以幫你

123
00:07:08,620 --> 00:07:12,720
Yeah. I'll make up a schedule and make sure you stick to it.
幫你訂出時間表 盯著你乖乖照做

124
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:15,220
Plus,it'll give me something to do.
我自己也有事做了

125
00:07:15,460 --> 00:07:17,760
You'd do that for me? Thanks.
真的？你願意幫我？

126
00:07:17,970 --> 00:07:21,330
We'll start slow. All you have to come up with tonight...
對 謝謝 一開始慢慢來 今晚之前...

128
00:07:21,640 --> 00:07:24,000
...is the name of your main character.
...只要想好主角名字

129
00:07:24,670 --> 00:07:26,400
-Done. -And it can't be Joey.
好了 不可以是喬伊 

130
00:07:26,670 --> 00:07:28,340
-It's not. -Or Joseph.
不是 也不能是約瑟夫

132
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:36,470
What's up?
你怎麼啦？

133
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:39,680
I just saw Danny on the subway with a girl...
我剛看到丹尼跟女生搭地鐵

134
00:07:39,890 --> 00:07:41,750
...and he had his arm around her.
他還摟著她

135
00:07:42,220 --> 00:07:43,320
Honey,I'm sorry.
我真為你難過

136
00:07:43,590 --> 00:07:45,920
You should be. This is all your fault.
你的確該難過，一切都要怪你

137
00:07:47,530 --> 00:07:50,400
You meddled in our relationship!
誰叫你插手我們的感情世界

138
00:07:50,670 --> 00:07:52,360
You had no relationship!
你們根本沒在一起

139
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:55,090
But I was doing my thing and everything...
不過我已經擬好計劃 

140
00:07:55,340 --> 00:07:57,400
...was going according to the plan!
一切都按部就班進行中

141
00:07:57,610 --> 00:08:00,670
Oh, God, stop with the plan!
拜託 別再提你的鳥計劃

142
00:08:02,110 --> 00:08:04,240
So what if you saw him with a girl?
你看到他跟女生在一起又如何 

143
00:08:04,450 --> 00:08:06,350
That doesn't mean anything.
那不代表什麼

144
00:08:06,550 --> 00:08:11,080
You'll go out with Danny and be so charming he'll forget all about...
你就快跟丹尼約會 到時你可以火力全開

146
00:08:11,290 --> 00:08:13,410
...that stupid subway girl.
迷得他忘記地鐵那個蠢妞

147
00:08:13,690 --> 00:08:15,710
She was kind of stupid.
那女生的確傻里傻氣

148
00:08:16,590 --> 00:08:19,920
You're right. I'm just going to go on the date.
你說得對 好，我就去約會

150
00:08:20,190 --> 00:08:24,530
I'm just going to go on the date. That is the new plan.
我會去赴約 這就是我的新計劃

151
00:08:26,470 --> 00:08:27,630
Hurry!
快點

152
00:08:42,650 --> 00:08:46,090
-How do you spell "suspicious"? -Why?
「多疑」怎麼寫？ 幹嘛？ 

153
00:08:46,390 --> 00:08:50,080
I think this character is going to be suspicious about stuff.
因為這個角色很「多疑」

154
00:08:51,964 --> 00:08:53,090
Yes!
帥！

155
00:08:53,930 --> 00:08:57,160
Chandler Bing, seven! Chandler Bing, zero!
錢德賓7分，錢德賓0分

156
00:08:58,270 --> 00:08:59,930
You're driving me crazy with that.
看你玩那個都快讓我抓狂了

157
00:09:00,130 --> 00:09:01,900
-I'll stop. -Don't stop.
我不玩就是了 繼續玩

158
00:09:02,140 --> 00:09:05,770
Move the bowl further away. Ross could make that shot.
碗拿遠一點 連羅斯都投得進

159
00:09:11,280 --> 00:09:14,650
Well, you suck. But at least you suck at a man's game now.
真是遜斃了 不過至少你進了成人組

160
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:17,780
-Want to play? -I can't play games.
要不要玩？ 我不能跟你玩 

162
00:09:17,990 --> 00:09:22,290
Ross'll be home soon. I have to write five pages to stick to his schedule.
羅斯就快回來了 按照他的時間表 我應該寫完5頁

163
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:26,120
So play for 30 minutes, then write until he gets home.
你可以先玩30分鐘 再繼續用功到他回家

164
00:09:26,860 --> 00:09:27,850
All right.
好吧

165
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:31,820
But listen,what do you say we...
不過 

166
00:09:32,100 --> 00:09:33,790
...crank it up a notch?
規則應該更困難

167
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,190
I'm intrigued.
願聞其詳

168
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:39,030
All right. All we need is a little lighter fluid.
要先找到可燃性液體

169
00:09:39,270 --> 00:09:42,370
But be careful. I want our security deposit back.
好，不過你小心點 我還想拿回房租押金

170
00:09:42,640 --> 00:09:46,440
We said goodbye to that when we invented hammer darts.
我們發明鐵錘標槍時 就拿不回來了

171
00:09:47,180 --> 00:09:51,050
Do you even remember which part of the wall is not spackle?
你記得哪面牆壁沒補過嗎？ 記得，這裡

173
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:57,020
Thank you! Happy holiday.
謝謝，佳節愉快

174
00:10:00,290 --> 00:10:03,390
No,that's trash,young lady. You can't
小姐，那可是垃圾，不可以…

175
00:10:03,630 --> 00:10:06,830
Stop that young lady! She donated trash!
別這樣，小姐，她竟然捐垃圾

176
00:10:10,910 --> 00:10:12,900
The charity's on fire!
樂捐筒著火了

177
00:10:13,140 --> 00:10:15,470
Help! Thank you. I need that!
來人啊 謝謝，我正需要

178
00:10:16,980 --> 00:10:18,710
What is this?
那是什麼鬼東西？

179
00:10:18,850 --> 00:10:21,470
It's 9:00 in the morning!
現在才早上9點耶

180
00:10:22,550 --> 00:10:25,040
All right. "A room."
我看看，場景，房間 

181
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:27,840
"A man enters. He looks suspicious."
一名男子滿臉狐疑地走進來

182
00:10:32,590 --> 00:10:34,120
That's it?
就這樣？

183
00:10:35,100 --> 00:10:38,160
You're supposed to have five pages done by now...
喬伊，你今天應該寫5頁 

184
00:10:38,370 --> 00:10:40,560
...including an exciting incident.
還包括一個高潮

185
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:47,200
What is all this? "The Official Rulebook of Fireball."
這是什麼垃圾？ 大火球遊戲規則

187
00:10:48,340 --> 00:10:50,040
That's the game we played.
我們剛在玩這遊戲

188
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:54,680
It's great. You take a tennis ball,a bowl and lighter
很好玩，道具就是一顆網球 一個碗、可燃液體

189
00:10:57,550 --> 00:11:00,950
This is helping your career? You wanted to be an actor.
這對你的事業有幫助嗎？我還以為你想當演員 

190
00:11:01,220 --> 00:11:04,450
Not the creator of "Crazy Lawsuit Game."
不是發明危險遊戲被人告

191
00:11:04,730 --> 00:11:06,920
You're right. I'll get back to work.
你說得對，我該工作了

192
00:11:07,190 --> 00:11:10,760
Shame on you! You should know better! Joey needs to work.
你真不應該，還帶壞他 明知道喬伊應該要工作

193
00:11:10,970 --> 00:11:12,900
Now come on.
振作點

195
00:11:14,300 --> 00:11:17,570
You can have this back when the five pages are done.
等你寫完5頁才還你

196
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:32,250
-I had a nice time tonight. -So did l.
我今晚很開心 我也是

197
00:11:32,450 --> 00:11:35,320
I'm really glad Monica asked us out.
幸好摩妮卡約我們出來

199
00:11:44,230 --> 00:11:47,220
I'd love to ask you in, but my sister's visiting.
我很想請你進去 不過我妹來住我家 

201
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:50,770
-I think she's asleep on the couch. -Your sister?
她可能睡在沙發上了 你妹妹？

202
00:11:51,010 --> 00:11:53,440
Your sister's asleep on the couch?
睡在沙發上？

203
00:11:53,740 --> 00:11:58,840
I saw you with her on the subway and now she's asleep on the couch!
我上次看到你們搭地鐵 現在她還睡在你沙發

204
00:12:00,150 --> 00:12:03,080
-I thought I heard you. -Hey,great,you're up.
我就猜是你 太好了，你起床了

205
00:12:03,350 --> 00:12:05,410
Rachel,my sister Krista.
瑞秋，這是我妹妹克莉絲塔

207
00:12:05,650 --> 00:12:06,810
Nice to meet you.
很高興認識你

208
00:12:07,090 --> 00:12:09,920
I wish you'd warned me. I'd have fixed myself up.
你應該告訴我要帶朋友回來 害我穿得邋裡邋遢

210
00:12:10,190 --> 00:12:13,020
-Like it would help. -You are so bad.
有差嗎？ 你真惡劣

212
00:12:13,260 --> 00:12:14,320
-You are. -You are.
你才是 是你

213
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:17,000
-You are. -You are!
是你 是你

215
00:12:17,260 --> 00:12:18,700
You are so dead.
你完蛋了

217
00:12:18,930 --> 00:12:21,090
I'm gonna get you. Come here!
我要教訓你一頓

218
00:12:30,110 --> 00:12:32,200
It's very nice to meet you.
很高興認識你

219
00:12:38,150 --> 00:12:41,050
Nobody! Nobody respects the bucket!
沒有人，沒一個人尊重募捐筒

220
00:12:41,590 --> 00:12:44,750
You wouldn't believe what people put in here!
大家都丟些莫名其妙的東西

221
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:48,050
Does this look like a garbage can to you?
你覺得這像垃圾桶嗎？

222
00:12:48,300 --> 00:12:50,460
Does it look like an ashtray?
不像 像煙灰缸嗎？

223
00:12:50,660 --> 00:12:52,830
Does it look like a urinal?
不像 像尿桶嗎？

224
00:12:54,670 --> 00:12:59,000
-So you going back out there? -Yeah, but I won't take any more crap.
菲比，你還要回去募捐嗎？ 當然，不過我受夠了

226
00:12:59,270 --> 00:13:01,670
No more Mrs. Nice Bucket.
再也不當募捐好好小姐

227
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:06,240
Good. You're tough. You lived on the street.
加油，你在街上流浪過，夠悍

228
00:13:06,450 --> 00:13:08,920
I'll go back to being Street Phoebe.
我要當回強人菲比

229
00:13:10,280 --> 00:13:15,310
But not totally back. Street Phoebe wouldn't be friends with you guys.
不過也不能一模一樣 否則才不會鳥你們 抱歉啦

230
00:13:18,990 --> 00:13:21,480
Can I ask you guys something?
可以問個問題嗎？ 當然

231
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:26,460
I don't have brothers,so I don't know, but did you guys wrestle?
我沒有兄弟，實在不暸解 你們會打來打去嗎？

233
00:13:26,670 --> 00:13:28,290
-Oh,yeah. -All the time.
當然會 常常

234
00:13:28,540 --> 00:13:31,270
In fact,I was undefeated.
而且我從沒輸過

236
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:34,770
Well,you weighed 200 pounds.
因為你以前90多公斤

237
00:13:36,710 --> 00:13:38,800
Still,I was quick as a cat.
不過我還是跟貓咪一樣矯捷

238
00:13:40,050 --> 00:13:42,310
I met Danny's sister yesterday.
我昨天碰到丹尼的妹妹

239
00:13:42,550 --> 00:13:45,850
-That was the girl on the subway. -You're kidding.
就是跟他一起搭地鐵的那個 真的假的？

241
00:13:46,050 --> 00:13:48,320
They were very,you know...
他們非常…

242
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:50,210
...wrestle-y.
...會扭打

243
00:13:50,490 --> 00:13:52,690
But I guess that's normal?
這樣正常嗎？

244
00:13:52,990 --> 00:13:54,790
We don't wrestle now.
我們現在不會這樣了

245
00:13:57,060 --> 00:13:59,560
Not since I got too strong for you.
自從我長大變壯後就不打了

246
00:14:00,670 --> 00:14:02,690
Too strong for me?
長大變壯？ 對

247
00:14:02,970 --> 00:14:04,730
You wanna go right now?
你要比劃一下嗎？

248
00:14:05,370 --> 00:14:08,540
I'll take you right now,buddy! You wanna go?
我可以立刻打敗你，信不信？

249
00:14:10,010 --> 00:14:11,000
Oh,fine.
沒問題

250
00:14:13,350 --> 00:14:14,540
Ready?
預備

251
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:16,650
Wrestle!
開始

252
00:14:21,390 --> 00:14:22,820
Okay,you know what?
這個嘛…很好 

253
00:14:23,020 --> 00:14:25,580
Actually,that helps a lot. Thanks.
謝謝你們幫了大忙

254
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:33,560
Let's go! The puck drops in 20 minutes!
趕快走，20分後就要開打了 喬伊，快點

255
00:14:33,930 --> 00:14:35,270
Joey's not going.
喬伊不能去

256
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:37,770
I didn't finish my five pages.
我還沒寫完5頁

257
00:14:39,040 --> 00:14:40,700
Finish them tomorrow.
明天再寫不就成了？

258
00:14:41,010 --> 00:14:43,530
Tomorrow he's redoing yesterday's pages.
因為他明天要修改昨天的5頁

259
00:14:43,780 --> 00:14:47,340
Yesterday's pages did not reflect my best work.
我昨天寫的有待改進

260
00:14:47,850 --> 00:14:51,750
Cut him some slack. If he relaxes, he'll get some work done.
別再逼他，讓他透口氣 搞不好會寫得更好

261
00:14:52,020 --> 00:14:55,510
I think he's been relaxing enough, thanks to you...
他已經透夠多氣了 這都要感謝你跟...

262
00:14:55,790 --> 00:14:57,050
...and Fireball.
...大火球

263
00:14:58,560 --> 00:15:02,550
If you think Fireball's relaxing, you've never played.
玩大火球可是很緊張 顯然你沒玩過

264
00:15:03,030 --> 00:15:05,520
You're doing this because you're bored.
你拚命壓搾喬伊 是因為你自己沒事做

265
00:15:05,770 --> 00:15:07,890
It's not his fault you're unemployed.
又不是喬伊害你失業的

266
00:15:08,140 --> 00:15:10,760
I am not unemployed. I'm on sabbatical!
我不是失業，只是進修中

267
00:15:11,810 --> 00:15:13,400
Guys,don't fight.
你們別吵架

268
00:15:13,640 --> 00:15:17,080
And I'm doing this because I am Joey's friend.
我之所以這麼做 是因為我是喬伊的朋友

269
00:15:17,310 --> 00:15:20,280
If you were a friend, you'd be doing the same.
如果你也是他朋友 就該學學我

270
00:15:20,550 --> 00:15:22,710
So being a friend means being a jerk?
當朋友就得這麼混帳？

271
00:15:22,950 --> 00:15:26,110
If it does,then you're an amazing friend of mine.
要是真如你所說 你可真是我第一號好友

272
00:15:26,620 --> 00:15:29,150
Let's settle this over a game of Fireball.
別吵了，大家玩場大火球 別氣了

273
00:15:29,390 --> 00:15:34,050
-I'll unhook the smoke detectors. -Let's settle this right now.
我去拆掉防火警鈴 現在就一了百了

275
00:15:34,300 --> 00:15:37,560
There. Now no one's going to the game.
好了，誰也不准去

276
00:15:38,600 --> 00:15:42,430
-I paid for those! -You said you would,but you didn't.
門票是我買的 才怪，你每次都說要付錢 卻一次也沒吐過錢

278
00:15:42,640 --> 00:15:43,860
Oh,yeah.
也對

279
00:15:50,680 --> 00:15:53,440
We finally get to the top of the mountain...
我們終於爬到山頂

280
00:15:53,650 --> 00:15:56,580
...and airhead here forgets the camera.
結果這個笨蛋竟然忘了相機

281
00:15:56,820 --> 00:15:59,680
The same thing happened to me one time.
我也發生過這種事情

282
00:16:01,190 --> 00:16:03,660
When did that happen to you?
什麼時候？

283
00:16:04,630 --> 00:16:07,620
Remember? We were jogging and saw that bird.
上次我們不是到公園慢跑 看到小鳥

284
00:16:07,830 --> 00:16:11,200
I wanted to take a picture, but I didn't have my camera.
我想拍下來 竟然沒帶相機

285
00:16:11,430 --> 00:16:14,200
Chasing the churro guy is not jogging.
也對，不過追小販可不算慢跑

286
00:16:15,870 --> 00:16:19,130
Oh,this is so good. You have got to try it.
超好吃，你一定要吃一口

287
00:16:30,180 --> 00:16:34,120
-Damn. I got it on my pants. -Here,I'll get it.
糟糕，褲子沾到了 我來擦

289
00:16:42,500 --> 00:16:44,660
We better take them off or the stain will set.
最好上樓換件褲子 否則以後洗不掉

290
00:16:44,870 --> 00:16:48,060
-I want to wear them tonight. -Oh,great.
而且我今晚約會還要穿 真好

292
00:16:49,300 --> 00:16:51,290
Okay, bye. Oh,my God!
再見，天哪

293
00:16:52,970 --> 00:16:55,570
-That was unbelievable. -See? I told you.
不可思議 看吧，我早說過了

294
00:16:55,840 --> 00:16:57,140
Yeah. Sorry.
可憐的瑞秋

295
00:16:57,380 --> 00:16:59,140
I don't believe they're brother and sister.
我不相信他們是兄妹

297
00:16:59,380 --> 00:17:01,410
They're brother and sister?!
他們是兄妹？

298
00:17:02,750 --> 00:17:04,620
I guess you'll have to cancel your date.
看來你得取消約會了

299
00:17:04,750 --> 00:17:07,280
And call their mother.
而且還要打電話給他們老媽

300
00:17:08,193 --> 00:17:10,627
「非尿桶」

301
00:17:11,730 --> 00:17:13,322
「我沒有百貨公司簡介」

302
00:17:19,100 --> 00:17:22,760
Wait a minute. Open your hand. Let me take a look.
等一下，手張開給我檢查

303
00:17:23,070 --> 00:17:26,940
Quarter,dime. Lint? Not interested in that.
兩毛五、一毛、線頭？不要

304
00:17:27,370 --> 00:17:29,500
What's this? A Canadian coin?
這是什麼？加拿大硬幣？

305
00:17:29,740 --> 00:17:31,730
Get out of here!
滾

306
00:17:34,950 --> 00:17:37,110
No drinks near the bucket.
不准在募捐筒旁邊喝東西

307
00:17:37,380 --> 00:17:41,120
Set it down there and then you can make a contribution.
先放在那邊才准捐款

308
00:17:41,520 --> 00:17:44,890
You can leave the "hurt bunny" look over there too.
少裝一副可憐兮兮的樣子

309
00:17:45,690 --> 00:17:46,750
Hi,Bob.
嗨，鮑柏

310
00:17:46,890 --> 00:17:49,450
I thought I told you to get out of here!
不是叫你滾了嗎？

311
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:54,090
Phoebe,we've been getting complaints.
菲比，我們接到申訴 

312
00:17:54,370 --> 00:17:57,600
-We're moving you to a less high-profile spot. -What？
上面要調你離開 什麼？

313
00:17:58,270 --> 00:18:02,610
-Ginger's taking this corner. -That chick can't handle my corner.
以後這裡由金傑負責 這小妞才沒這能耐

316
00:18:03,580 --> 00:18:06,240
Look, either you leave or we remove you.
你不走，我們就得趕你走

317
00:18:06,810 --> 00:18:07,800
Fine.
好

318
00:18:14,390 --> 00:18:18,090
I'll give you one pointer. Look out for that bitch.
勸你一句，注意那個臭婆娘

319
00:18:27,800 --> 00:18:32,570
-I thought we said 7. -You know what? Let's skip it.
瑞秋，不是約7點嗎？ 今天就算了

321
00:18:32,840 --> 00:18:34,470
What? Why?
什麼？為什麼？

322
00:18:35,240 --> 00:18:39,110
You and your sister seem to have a very special bond
你們兄妹似乎…非常要好

323
00:18:39,310 --> 00:18:42,940
Oh,great. That "special bond" again.
太好了，又說這句話

324
00:18:44,520 --> 00:18:48,650
Why do women have a problem with my being close to my sister?
我跟我妹感情好 又是哪裡讓女人看不順眼了？

325
00:18:48,860 --> 00:18:52,450
-I don't know, but..  -Do you have brothers?
聽我說，我不知道事實真相 你有兄弟嗎？

326
00:18:52,760 --> 00:18:57,660
No,I have two sisters. But one has a very masculine energy.
我有兩個妹妹 其中一個很像男人婆

328
00:18:58,270 --> 00:19:01,790
-Are you close? -No. They're not very nice people.
你們要好嗎？ 沒有，她們不是好人

330
00:19:04,540 --> 00:19:07,470
I like you. I think this could go somewhere.
我很喜歡你 應該可以順利交往

332
00:19:07,670 --> 00:19:11,670
So I'm close to my family. Don't let it stand in our way.
我是跟家人感情深厚 你就為了這點不鳥我？

333
00:19:11,950 --> 00:19:14,180
Well,I don't know....
我也不知道…

334
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:16,710
When you put it that way
聽你這麼說也有道理 

335
00:19:16,950 --> 00:19:20,440
Danny? Hurry up. The bath's getting cold.
丹尼 快點 洗澡水快涼了

336
00:19:24,690 --> 00:19:26,020
-What？ -I'll see you later.
又怎麼了？ 我先走了

338
00:19:30,700 --> 00:19:33,560
There's some kids playing in the street.
路上有小孩在玩耍

339
00:19:33,830 --> 00:19:37,170
Want to go give them a project, ruin their day?
你要不要去叫他們寫作業 毀了他們的一天？

340
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:41,040
If they have a ball, you could stick razors in it...
如果你手邊有球 就可以插上剃刀

341
00:19:41,240 --> 00:19:44,840
...and teach them a new game: "Gonna-Need-Stitches Ball."
教他們玩「殺人球」

342
00:19:46,150 --> 00:19:51,080
Hey,guys! I was at the library. I already finished my five pages.
我整個早上都待在圖書館 已經寫完今天的5頁了

344
00:19:51,320 --> 00:19:54,580
Now we can go to the Ranger game last night!
那我們可以去看昨晚的騎兵隊比賽了

345
00:19:56,160 --> 00:19:59,250
No,dude. Ross tore up the tickets.
不行，門票給羅斯撕掉了

346
00:20:03,760 --> 00:20:08,430
I guess without so many distractions it's easier for you to focus?
沒有讓你分心的事情 就比較容易專心吧？

347
00:20:08,740 --> 00:20:13,760
Also without somebody breathing down your neck all the livelong day!
沒人整天跟在你屁股後面 也比較得心應手吧？

348
00:20:15,340 --> 00:20:19,940
The important thing is, I finished it. And I think it's really good.
隨便你們說，總之我寫完了 而且寫得還不錯

349
00:20:20,250 --> 00:20:24,620
But it would help if I could hear it. Would you guys read it for me?
不過你們幫忙念台詞 才是幫大忙 可不可以念一下？

352
00:20:25,220 --> 00:20:26,740
-Yeah,all right. -All right.
好吧 好

353
00:20:30,060 --> 00:20:32,390
"It's a typical New York apartment.
「一間普通的紐約公寓」

354
00:20:32,630 --> 00:20:35,560
Two guys are hanging out."
「兩個男人正在家裡」，羅斯

355
00:20:38,930 --> 00:20:39,920
"Hey,man."
嗨

356
00:20:40,900 --> 00:20:42,430
"What is up?"
有什麼事？

357
00:20:44,040 --> 00:20:47,800
"About yesterday. I was really wrong. I am sorry."
昨天是我錯了，對不起

358
00:20:48,110 --> 00:20:51,540
"No,it was me. I'm sorry. I overreacted."
我才該道歉，我反應過頭了

359
00:20:51,750 --> 00:20:56,110
"Maybe it was both of us. But we had our best friend's inter
或許我們都有錯 反正我們都是為了朋友…

360
00:20:59,050 --> 00:21:03,420
But we had our best friend's interest at heart."
我們都是為了朋友好

361
00:21:03,790 --> 00:21:05,990
"Could I be more sorry?"
我非常不好意思

362
00:21:11,570 --> 00:21:14,560
"l don't know. I am one sorry...
我才是該道歉的...

363
00:21:15,270 --> 00:21:17,570
...polontologist."
...古生物學家

364
00:21:21,610 --> 00:21:23,470
All right, Joey, we get it.
喬伊，我們懂了

365
00:21:24,340 --> 00:21:26,440
-I'm sorry. -I'm sorry too.
對不起 我也該道歉

366
00:21:26,650 --> 00:21:29,510
Keep reading. The good part's coming up.
你們要繼續讀下去 精采的才要上場，繼續念

367
00:21:32,090 --> 00:21:35,110
"l am sorry, Chandler."
對不起，錢德

368
00:21:35,320 --> 00:21:37,520
"l am sorry, Ross."
對不起，羅斯

369
00:21:39,630 --> 00:21:41,990
"A handsome man enters."
「帥哥上場」

371
00:21:45,300 --> 00:21:50,260
"l don't know what you're talking about, but I'd like to thank you both.
不知道你們在扯什麼 不過我要向你們兩位道謝

373
00:21:50,500 --> 00:21:53,130
You. You wouldn't let me give up on myself.
你讓我不放棄自己

374
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:54,710
And you.
你

375
00:21:54,980 --> 00:21:56,940
You co-created Fireball."
你與我一起創造了大火球

376
00:21:58,880 --> 00:22:00,370
"The End."
「劇終」

377
00:22:01,680 --> 00:22:03,810
This took you all day?
這就花了你一整天？

378
00:22:05,020 --> 00:22:06,950
No, this took five minutes.
沒有，我只寫了5分鐘

379
00:22:07,190 --> 00:22:12,020
I spent the rest of the day coming up with new Ultimate Fireball!
其他時間都在寫 「終極大火球」遊戲規則

380
00:22:17,100 --> 00:22:22,900
It's a typical New York apartment. Two girls are just hanging out. Go.
場景在一般紐約公寓 屋內有兩個女生

382
00:22:23,640 --> 00:22:27,230
-"Hi,how are you doing,Kelly?" -"I'm doing just fine.
